Object.assign(DIALOG_CLIPS.clips,{"tom|You licked my mail.":"","rose|A LITTLE.":"","deedee|Tommy! There you are. Sit. No, stand. Read it. Read it out loud. I have read it eleven times.":"","tom|\"THE MOON CLUB requests the pleasure of TOM. Tonight, at moonrise. Admit three. Adults only. Dress: your very best.\"":"","rose|It smells like a candle. I licked it a little.":"","tom|Gold wax seal. A little clock on it.":"","tom|You went?":"","ellie|Darling, I went to everything. The last dance. A big silver ball turned all night. Then they locked the doors and nobody ever said why.":"","ellie|I left a coat there. Purple velvet. I was in a hurry.":"","deedee|And now the moon is missing. Three nights. I power walk at nine. I walked straight into the Hendersons’ hedge.":"","tom|A missing moon, a locked club, and a little gold clock. Everybody get your shoes.":"","luna|Oh! Visitors. At night. Is that... is that an INVITATION?":"","tom|The Moon Club. Tonight. Admit three.":"","deedee|Honey, show her the seal.":"","luna|Twelve years I have swept this floor. That little silver door in the back has never once opened. I thought it was a closet.":"","boppy|Nobody is here. A party and nobody is here.":"","tom|Look at the east window. Moonlight. Just a thread of it.":"","deedee|The plaque says MEMBERS ARE ADMITTED BY MOONLIGHT. And look, three little brass stands. Somebody took the mirrors.":"","boppy|A coat check, a card room, a ballroom. Three rooms. Three stands. I count three suspects.":"","boppy|Assistant Deputy Warden. Rikers. I know what a lineup looks like.":"","tom|And our mirror is hanging off your other shoulder.":"","log|Nobody gets anything without a ticket.":"","deedee|Okay, everybody up. Deedee is a nurse. Up, up. Little sip of water. Good.":"","log|...Okay. Okay. You can take it to her. Tell her I held on the whole time.":"","tom|A round mirror in a brass frame. It says MIRROR 1 on the back. It goes on a stand in the hall.":"","boppy|The mailbox moved.":"","deedee|You ARE a sore loser, honey.":"","toad|...Best two out of three?":"","deedee|Look at you. Making a friend.":"","tom|A round mirror in a brass frame. It says MIRROR 2 on the back. It goes on a stand in the hall.":"","mudling|Every song, 1924 to 1971. I stood right here. Nobody. Ever.":"","tom|She?":"","deedee|Oh, sweetheart. Nobody asked you to dance, did they?":"","mudling|...You were very nice about it. For a fight. Here. The mirror. It was the big one, over the bandstand, before she came.":"","tom|A round mirror in a brass frame. It says MIRROR 3 on the back. It goes on a stand in the hall.":"","deedee|Fifty-two years, and he still asks. Every time.":"","deedee|Admitted by moonlight. Oh, I have goosebumps. Tommy, feel my arm.":"","tom|So you took the moon.":"","bigone|I CAUGHT it. All of it. Every bit of moonlight, right here in me.":"","bigone|Then they can come UP. One more dance. Just one. Everybody, under me, forever.":"","boppy|Forever is a lot of dancing. And everybody dances too fast.":"","bigone|Every full moon, they danced under me. Then the last dance. The band said see you next moon. Nobody came back.":"","tom|Deedee, Boppy, behind me. No touching, please.":"","deedee|Up, everybody. Deedee is a nurse.":"","bigone|One dance. Before you go. Somebody. Please.":"","tom|I mostly sway.":"","deedee|Then sway with your mother.":"","deedee|Tommy. Dance with your mother.":"","boppy|Something fell out of her top. On the bandstand. Something gold.":"","tom|The sundial. The steamer. The sign-up sheet. My jar. The book from 1952. The oven from 1963. Now a mirrorball from 1971.":"","grace|TATA! The MOON came back! We saw it from the window! Aunt Ellie said it was probably you.":"","deedee|Ellie. There was a BALL. A big silver one. She remembered you. And look what we brought home.":"","ellie|...My coat. Ticket seven.":"","tom|A boarding pass. \"BOARDING GROUP 0. FROM: LONG ISLAND. TO: NOWHERE. GATE: TO BE ANNOUNCED.\" And a little gold clock.":"","grace|Tata. Somebody wants you to go on a TRIP.":"","luna|If you see the moon up there, please tell it to come home. My telescope misses it.":"","ellie|Go. Dance. Somebody in this family should get to finish a party at the Moon Club.":"","luna|The door is open. Twelve years I have swept this floor, and that door is open.":"","skeeter|Nobody has come to the door since 1971. I have kept the line VERY tidy.":"","skeeter|Back of the line! Round two!":"","ellie|My coat. Ticket seven. I left it at the last dance and never went back for it.":"","skeeter|Round 2. Still not on the list.":"","skeeter|Round 3. Still not on the list.":"","skeeter|Round 4. Still not on the list.":"","skeeter|Round 5. Still not on the list.":"","skeeter|I hold everyone back. Nobody ever asks to go in with me.":"","skeeter|The list. Everybody wants to be on the list.":"","grump|Black tie. Black TIE. Is that a fishing vest? At the Moon Club?":"","grump|Nobody dresses up anymore. Nobody even irons.":"","grump|Round 2. Still starched.":"","grump|Round 3. Still starched.":"","grump|Round 4. Still starched.":"","grump|Hmph! Round two!":"","grump|Round 5. Still starched.":"","log|Hang on! Round two!":"","log|Round 2. Still holding on.":"","log|Round 3. Still holding on.":"","log|Round 5. Still holding on.":"","log|Round 4. Still holding on.":"","toad|Fifty-five years in this deck. Every game they play, they take me out first.":"","toad|Rematch! Round two!":"","toad|Round 2. Best 2 out of 2.":"","toad|Round 3. Best 3 out of 3.":"","toad|Round 4. Best 4 out of 4.":"","toad|Round 5. Best 5 out of 5.":"","toad|...rigged. The whole game is RIGGED.":"","toad|Best two out of three. Best three out of five.":"","mudling|Every dance, I stood right here. Every song. Nobody ever asked.":"","mudling|Oh no. Round two.":"","mudling|Round 2. Still against the wall.":"","mudling|Round 3. Still against the wall.":"","mudling|Round 4. Still against the wall.":"","mudling|Round 5. Still against the wall.":"","mudling|Nobody asked me. In 1971. Or since.":"","bigone|Every full moon they danced under me. Then the last dance, and the doors closed.":"","bigone|From the top! Round two!":"","bigone|Round 2. The band plays on.":"","bigone|Round 3. The band plays on.":"","bigone|Round 5. The band plays on.":"","bigone|Round 4. The band plays on.":"","bigone|...one more song. Just one.":"","bigone|They said see you next moon. 1971.":"","amy|Report cards AND a 10K on Saturday. Go. Take Mom and Dad. Make Dad wear the tie.":"","sal|Airport? You just got here. Your mother called the depot. Three times. Something about a letter.":"","sal|She said, and I quote, \"tell him it has a SEAL.\"":"","deedee|Admit three, Tommy. You. Me. And Boppy.":"","deedee|You drove into the mailbox twice, honey.":"","boppy|A slow one. My stomach gets one song. One. Deedee. May I.":"","bigone|Guests! GUESTS! Oh, at last. Welcome to the Moon Club. Nobody has come up those stairs since 1971.":"","deedee|Tommy, whatever her shiny side shows bounces right back. Use something else. And honey, nobody has asked her to dance since 1971. Three times.":"","luna|I swept the club stairs. Twelve years of wondering, and it was just a very dusty party.":""});
Object.assign(DIALOG_CLIPS.voices,{"grace":{"model":"eleven_v4","direction":"","designed":false,"voice_id":"i4CzbCVWoqvD0P1QJCUL","name":"Ivy","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8}},"rose":{"voice_id":"ocZQ262SsZb9RIxcQBOj","name":"Lulu Lolipop - High-Pitched and Bubbly  (female, young, american, characters_animation)","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.85},"direction":"","designed":false},"tom":{"voice_id":"cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal","name":"Eric - Smooth, Trustworthy","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.85},"direction":"","designed":false},"deedee":{"model":"eleven_v4","direction":"","designed":false,"voice_id":"3atomJkX2UWSHPSg86Z0","name":"AoT Deedee (Long Island)","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8}},"ellie":{"model":"eleven_v4","direction":"","designed":true,"voice_id":"5nPpmcfu7pDFPztXuQIJ","name":"AoT Aunt Ellie (Long Island)","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"desc":"A very elderly woman in her nineties with a grand, theatrical, sharp-witted voice and a refined mid-Atlantic accent. Dry, imperious and glamorous, slow deliberate delivery, every line a bon mot. Clean studio recording."},"boppy":{"voice_id":"QzTKubutNn9TjrB7Xb2Q","name":"Jerry B. - New York Italian Mobster  (male, middle_aged, new york, characters_animation)","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":1},"direction":"deep gravelly voice","designed":false},"luna":{"voice_id":"qCj5kMANfHcvCnzG1gVB","name":"AoT Luna","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A woman in her thirties with a dreamy, slow, wonder-filled American voice. Soft and spacey, drifting pauses, sincere awe with a touch of embarrassment. Clean studio recording."},"log":{"voice_id":"DmA9AOv6Fsic2LQdqVVM","name":"AoT Log Lump","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A sleepy cartoon log creature, very slow, deep, woody and drowsy voice, yawning between words, mumbly and content. Animated character voice."},"toad":{"voice_id":"jcb48kKcDpNXjAxnAP2c","name":"AoT Bog Toad","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A huge cartoon toad, deep croaky throaty voice with a rumbling ribbit, territorial and proud, a bit vain. Animated character voice."},"mudling":{"voice_id":"E2hOWZ8x3nGJuQURP3SG","name":"AoT Mudling","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A small, silly cartoon creature made of mud, gloopy gurgling voice with wet bubbly consonants, slow and sulky, childlike and a little sad. Animated character voice."},"bigone":{"voice_id":"qDteMRfOWoUEc7kcfWvl","name":"AoT The Big One","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"An enormous ancient cartoon pond fish, huge slow booming bass voice with gurgling bubbles, pompous and boastful but childlike and easily delighted underneath. Animated character voice."},"skeeter":{"voice_id":"3NkCp1SubvPIw3g0s7Rf","name":"AoT Skeeter Swarm","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A cartoon swarm of mosquitoes speaking as one, high-pitched, thin, whiny and buzzy voice with a nasal zzz on every s, nosy and impatient. Animated character voice."},"grump":{"voice_id":"moX2FuSiiLmOw0uEq4OU","name":"AoT Pond Grump","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A grumpy cartoon swamp creature, low gravelly grumbling voice, cranky and wet-sounding, easily offended, a big softie underneath. Animated character voice."},"amy":{"model":"eleven_v4","direction":"heavy Long Island accent","designed":false,"voice_id":"HLSHrV3D7Gp6sEFcHNev","name":"AoT Amy (Kind)","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8}},"sal":{"voice_id":"gcJ5PkVgShIxtP5HgbZK","name":"AoT Sal","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A man in his fifties with a thick Long Island New York accent, a slightly nasal, raspy, fast and friendly voice. Chatty taxi driver, warm and a little dramatic, proud of his one cab. Clean studio recording."},"tnb":{"voice_id":"QPmHuIriDGOvu1d9U7wn","name":"SuperDale - a mid-age voice & Friendly  (male, middle_aged, us midwest, informative_educational)","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.85},"direction":"","designed":false},"boomie":{"voice_id":"FgGtmhYdBou3a14mKYgx","name":"AoT Boomie","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A woman in her forties with a big, warm, rich singer’s voice, bubbly and motherly, slides into song mid-sentence, laughs from the belly. Clean studio recording."},"bean":{"voice_id":"zROpM0X5rfQMe4CN4C7f","name":"AoT Bean","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A man in his late twenties with an upbeat, rambling, friendly American voice. A little scattered, quick bursts of words, cheerful and unbothered. Light and bright. Clean studio recording."},"carmen":{"voice_id":"8ncJvaxiyfELP457mBLS","name":"AoT Doña Carmen","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A woman in her sixties with a warm, firm, proud voice and a light Salvadoran Spanish accent. Runs a pupuseria, generous and no-nonsense, laughs easily. Clean studio recording."},"pistachio":{"voice_id":"LyoSZrqTSG25l7i0uBGl","name":"AoT Mr. Pistachio","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A man in his late fifties with a warm, hearty Long Island New York accent, an ice cream shop owner who loves his regulars, booming friendly laugh, talks with his hands, a little dramatic about his scoops. Clean studio recording."},"brainfreeze":{"voice_id":"kYM9iwUI7t87mhAOBs1T","name":"AoT Brain Freeze","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A cartoon villain who is a walking chest freezer: a flat, cold, humming monotone with a slight metallic buzz, deadpan and sulky, slow and heavy, with a lonely sadness underneath that cracks through when he is surprised. Animated character voice."},"boomie2":{"voice_id":"rrjdoujYPDo3FGeRqm3Q","name":"AoT Boomie","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A young Black American woman in her late thirties to early fourties with a warm, rich, low alto voice, smooth and a little husky, deeper than most women’s voices. A gospel and soul singer, kind and bubbly, laughs from the belly, slides into song mid-sentence. Clean studio recording."},"dot":{"voice_id":"gYzudf4C0nXnEecqXK5t","name":"AoT Dot","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A small woman in her forties with a quick, crisp, precise American voice, slightly nasal. Talks fast in short exact phrases like she is reading a tally sheet. Proud of her accuracy. Clean studio recording."},"la_woman":{"voice_id":"eLXwnyHT9UJHbuyheJ9m","name":"AoT LA neighbor (woman)","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A woman in her early thirties with a relaxed, warm, slightly husky Los Angeles voice. Easygoing, wry, a little tired, friendly neighbor energy. Clean studio recording."},"michael":{"voice_id":"24fSFWvKYGI0zVR7L6JQ","name":"AoT Michael","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A tall man in his early forties with a calm, low, dry American voice. A tech dad holding two kids, patient, deadpan, quietly funny, a little tired. Clean studio recording."},"penny":{"voice_id":"C0jocNoR6bwrjLXwelto","name":"AoT Penny","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A woman in her forties with a fast-talking, bright, enthusiastic American saleswoman voice. Quick patter, playful, warm and a little pushy, every line a pitch. Clean studio recording."},"page":{"voice_id":"UnNThlnnIcLaHiWDpFdl","name":"AoT Page","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A man in his forties, a librarian with a hushed, dry, whispery American voice. Speaks very quietly and precisely, mildly scandalized by everything, droll. Soft breathy whisper. Clean studio recording."},"olivia":{"voice_id":"3KdkB2LF6PUw0muuS0j7","name":"AoT Olivia","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A woman in her late thirties with a quick, bright, articulate American voice. A journalist and mom of two little kids, talks fast, wry and warm, always half distracted. Clean studio recording."},"justin":{"voice_id":"Pp9gl3BrnVq62dIWU2sx","name":"AoT Justin (Long Island)","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A man in his early forties with an easygoing, friendly voice, Long Island born with a slight country twang. Goofy proud dad, handyman, sports fan, relaxed and warm, quick to laugh. Clean studio recording."},"gus":{"voice_id":"CcabrpeMRBXae9HlsCuq","name":"AoT Gus","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"An old man in his seventies with a slow, warm, slightly creaky American voice. Deadpan and dignified, treats sitting on a bench like serious athletic training. Unhurried. Clean studio recording."},"oolong":{"voice_id":"2PhKaj7sDKqdDEhqQyhl","name":"AoT Oolong","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"An elderly woman in her seventies with a warm, gossipy, conspiratorial voice and a light British accent. Leans in to share secrets, little cackle of a laugh, cozy and sly. Clean studio recording."},"washington":{"voice_id":"ARRjeRIXQjOrcraWRDoq","name":"AoT Mr. Washington","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"An elderly man in his eighties with a deep, warm, slow voice and a gentle hint of Louisiana in it. A neighborhood storyteller on his porch, unhurried, kind, a little gravelly. Clean studio recording."}});
